				"此外，&6Tinker Station&r 可以让你&a修理&r或&a更换&r工具的&e组件&r。"
				"{image:ftbquests:textures/gui/supporoform_tinkers_construct/tinker_station_ui.png width:98 height:50 align:center fit:true}"
				""
				"&aRepairing&r a tool requires the same &dMaterial&r that you &aused&r to craft it:"
